      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "CSD OTLP is not enabled (`intern_parallel`). Journal has no trace_id today; this dashboard + Loki derived field + correlation are ready for when lines appear. Jaeger datasource is LAN `172.30.0.15:16686` (Apache-2.0). No Tempo. Jaeger UI is not published on WAN.",
